    IF `the shares are held by the company as treasury shares on the date of the offer` OR `the shares become shares held by the company as treasury shares after that date but before a specified date`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "“relevant treasury shares” means shares that—"

